# MIT License — reusable project infrastructure

This license covers the repository's reusable project infrastructure:

- `examples/` — the runnable companion programs (also carries its own
  local copy of this grant in `examples/LICENSE`)
- `scripts/` — build, TOC/index generation, and verification utilities
- `tools/` — the lint and checking toolchain
- `Makefile` and the build configuration it drives
- `docs/github-markdown-math-bugs.md`, `docs/render-tests/`, and
  `docs/upstream-feedback/` — the renderer-bug knowledge base
- `PROCESS.md` and `STYLE.md` — the reusable process and style
